@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+## 1. Implementation
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Add `JsonPatchError` and share pointer parsing in `src/index.ts` (internal, not exported publicly)
+- [ ] 1.2 Add safe deep clone and deep equality helpers (own-property writes via `defineProperty`)
+- [ ] 1.3 Implement patch/operation structure validation (RFC 6902 §3)
+- [ ] 1.4 Implement `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, `test` and export `applyPatch`
+
+## 2. Tests
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Tests in `test/patch.test.ts` for validation scenarios (non-array, bad `op`, missing members, invalid pointers, extra members, null value)
+- [ ] 2.2 Tests for `add`, `remove`, `replace` scenarios incl. arrays, `-`, root, escaping, empty key, `__proto__`
+- [ ] 2.3 Tests for `move`, `copy`, `test` scenarios incl. prefix error, equality edge cases
+- [ ] 2.4 Tests for atomicity, non-mutation of document and patch, and `JsonPatchError` type
+- [ ] 2.5 Run `npm test` and confirm everything passes
